_4} →         [inst : CommRing R] →           [inst_1 : CommRing S] →           
  [inst_2 : Algebra R S] →               Algebra.Presentation R S ι σ →         
        (R₀ : Type u_5) →                   [inst_3 : CommRing R₀] →            
         [inst_4 : Algebra R₀ R] → [inst_5 : Algebra R₀ S] → [IsScalarTower R₀ R
 S] → Prop
参数：R₀ : Type u_5。
黑盒内容：本声明未引用其他定理/引理；其成立仅依赖定义、结构与类型类实例。

--- 原说明 ---
A ring `R₀` has the coefficients of the presentation `P` if the coefficients of 
the relations of `P`
lie in the image of `R₀` in `R`.
The smallest subring of `R` satisfying this is given by `Algebra.Presentation.Co
re P`.
-/
class HasCoeffs (R₀ : Type*) [CommRing R₀] [Algebra R₀ R] [Algebra R₀ S]
    [IsScalarTower R₀ R S] where
  coeffs_subset_range : P.coeffs ⊆ Set.range (algebraMap R₀ R)

